    "name": "PlanetSmith",
    "steam_appid": 2539340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlanetSmith is a massive procedurally generated hexagonal block voxel game! Explore vast planets, survive hostile territory, build a spaceship and explore the solar system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique worlds using an innovative generation system that offers a spectrum of sizes, allowing quick circumnavigations to weeks-long odysseys. These procedurally generated worlds feature cold polar biomes, scorching equatorial deserts, large continents to conquer, and charming clusters of islands dotting deep blue oceans \u2013 creating a vast scope for exploration and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You've crashed landed on an earth-like planet, with no way to escape and get home. You'll need to explore this new world and uncover all of its secrets both above and below ground in order to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open exploration on a huge planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build tools, shelter, and weapons to help you survive the dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange robots patrol the surface, you'll need to keep your wits about you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dungeons and plumb their depths to find technological artefacts so that you can...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... build your spaceship and head out into the solar system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If being creative is more your style, we have a full featured passive Creative Mode in the game where you can explore and build to your heart's content. We even have crazy tools not available in Survival Mode that allow you to do everything from blast massive holes in the planets, summon swarms of asteroids, or plant trees with our new type of dynamite - TNTree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHERE WE ARE HEADING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of discovery after awakening in a mysterious new world teeming with opportunities, challenges and hidden dangers. Explore and gather essential resources to construct shelters to ensure survival and success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge tools that enable you to dig deep into the earth, unearthing hidden treasures and uncovering ancient secrets. Gather precious materials and grow crafting prowess, which leads to the ability to fashion increasingly advanced gear that opens up new horizons of exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a destiny \u2013 tame the planet and its mysteries, or become the ultimate explorer by designing and building an interplanetary spaceship capable of taking you to the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a tranquil realm of boundless creativity with Creative Mode. Step into a world where imagination sets the course \u2013 sculpt landscapes, erect monumental structures, craft intricate houses, or even breathe life into colossal characters; the possibilities are ready and waiting to be defined. Unleash artistic spirit, design awe-inspiring monuments, and then proudly showcase any creations, inviting others to marvel at these displays of ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/e49e416afd9ff7007b35f85732d3a112.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlanetSmith is a massive procedurally generated hexagonal block voxel game! Explore vast planets, survive hostile territory, build a spaceship and explore the solar system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique worlds using an innovative generation system that offers a spectrum of sizes, allowing quick circumnavigations to weeks-long odysseys. These procedurally generated worlds feature cold polar biomes, scorching equatorial deserts, large continents to conquer, and charming clusters of islands dotting deep blue oceans \u2013 creating a vast scope for exploration and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/1692dcf0f664a813c62825ba81d42829.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You've crashed landed on an earth-like planet, with no way to escape and get home. You'll need to explore this new world and uncover all of its secrets both above and below ground in order to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open exploration on a huge planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build tools, shelter, and weapons to help you survive the dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange robots patrol the surface, you'll need to keep your wits about you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dungeons and plumb their depths to find technological artefacts so that you can...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... build your spaceship and head out into the solar system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.poster.avif?t=1754364980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.webm?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539340/extras/a1b8401cd96d9d6bbd458e0af7251d48.mp4?t=1754364980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If being creative is more your style, we have a full featured passive Creative Mode in the game where you can explore and build to your heart's content. We even have crazy tools not available in Survival Mode that allow you to do everything from blast massive holes in the planets, summon swarms of asteroids, or plant trees with our new type of dynamite - TNTree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHERE WE ARE HEADING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of discovery after awakening in a mysterious new world teeming with opportunities, challenges and hidden dangers. Explore and gather essential resources to construct shelters to ensure survival and success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge tools that enable you to dig deep into the earth, unearthing hidden treasures and uncovering ancient secrets. Gather precious materials and grow crafting prowess, which leads to the ability to fashion increasingly advanced gear that opens up new horizons of exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a destiny \u2013 tame the planet and its mysteries, or become the ultimate explorer by designing and building an interplanetary spaceship capable of taking you to the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a tranquil realm of boundless creativity with Creative Mode. Step into a world where imagination sets the course \u2013 sculpt landscapes, erect monumental structures, craft intricate houses, or even breathe life into colossal characters; the possibilities are ready and waiting to be defined. Unleash artistic spirit, design awe-inspiring monuments, and then proudly showcase any creations, inviting others to marvel at these displays of ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore procedurally generated spherical planets in this hexagonal block voxel game! Navigate large open worlds from cold polar caps to scorching deserts. Delve deep into dungeons to defeat bosses, find artefacts, and craft your very own spaceship before launching off to other worlds!",
